WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:10.770
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:10.400
Oh my, he looks just as cool as always~

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.980
This year, I will definitely capture your heart.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.790
closed captions

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:17.350
If I remember correctly, last year's Valentine's day was horrible.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:19.270
Makoto-kun.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:22.630
Here. My Valentine's present to you.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:25.110
It's fondant chocolat, I just made it, so it's piping hot.

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.080
Try it.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:37.100
<i>C-Could this be an indirect kiss?</i>

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:41.430
I'll be honest with you.

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:47.930
Woah, already!? But Makoto-kun's feelings, how do I put it, I already sort of had a vibe about them...

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:50.940
You can just say it lightly, just lightly!

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.900
After you've tried it yourself, you noticed it, didn't you?

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:56.560
The dry texture this fondant chocolat has.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:02.040
Please only bake through about nine tenths of the fondant chocolat.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:05.500
You should have learned this in first year. Have you forgotten it?

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:10.100
Also with this type of cake, it doesn't absorb the flavour immediately.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:14.170
If you intend to give it as a present, you should give it a day or two after making it.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:17.340
And then the accompanying fruit sauce.

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.470
The taste was too thick, and mismatched for this cake.

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.390
That's all from me.

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:24.100
I shall return this to you.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.620
That was a total shock.

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:32.070
Who would've figured he would even harshly grade a Valentine's chocolate...

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:37.690
Oh yes, that lass who's been loitering around my dear Makoto-kun recently....

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:41.240
It's about time that I teach her where her place is.

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:43.760
Amano Ichigo...

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:53.080
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:53.080
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:58.470
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:58.470
I'll give you happiness, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:03.940
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, hapinesu made go!

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:03.940
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, Happiness made go!

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:09.110
chansu no tobira aketa toki kara kibun joujou ↑ ↑

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:09.110
Since I opened the door of chance, my mood lifted.

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:13.090
youkoso suiitsu no oukoku he

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:13.090
Welcome to the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:13.970
Bon appétit!

00:02:13.970 --> 00:02:21.350
hajimehane, hetappi demo megezu ni hibishoujin<i>!</i>

00:02:13.970 --> 00:02:21.350
Though I was terrible at the beginning, I was diligent everyday<i>!</i>

