Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:29.840
recipe 19

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:29.840
Happy Valentine

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.300
I wonder which shelf has Callebaut chocolate?

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:35.690
Oh, here it is, Rumi-san.

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:39.610
Oh god, this is pretty expensive.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:44.520
But if you're going to make delicious chocolate, Callebaut is the way to go.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:45.620
Hey, hey.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:49.490
Speaking of, who will you give your Valentine's chocolate to?

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:52.000
Eh? Why are you asking all of a sudden?

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:55.710
Because, if you're making chocolate, you're going to give it away, right?

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:56.940
Well, yeah I guess...

00:03:56.940 --> 00:04:00.030
I want to hear, I want to hear about Rumi-san's love story!

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:03.410
Well, I do have a guy that I've been dating for about half a year now.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:07.720
His name is Takuya, but it's a long distance relationship and we've only gone on about two dates.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.710
Eh? Rumi-san has a boyfriend!?

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:14.940
A long distance relationship? It's like a drama! Amazing~

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:18.070
No good, it's so embarrassing that my face is burning up.

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:21.190
So, how about you, Ichigo-chan?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:21.570
Eh?

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.840
Do you have someone that you give stuff to every Valentine's day or something?

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:28.280
Y-Yeah. There is one.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:31.730
Wow! Who is it, who is it, tell me!

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:32.990
Papa!

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:37.440
For now, let's buy this Callebaut chocolate.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:40.360
Ah! It looks like it's 10% off!

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:42.170
I-Indeed...

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:46.650
Oh. I was wondering who you could be, but it's Amano Ichigo-san.

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:51.810
Are you planning to use these discounted ingredients to make your Valentine's chocolate?

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.180
Is that bad?

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:59.160
Doesn't matter. Well, discounted chocolate <i>does</i> suit cheap love.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:04.850
By the way, I'm planning to order the highest quality of Callebaut chocolate directly from France.

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:07.410
In order to get the highest quality of love, that is.

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:12.850
In love, I don't think that stuff like "cheap ways" or "highest quality" matters.

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:16.420
The only thing that matters is the pure feeling for your partner!

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.500
Ichigo-chan...

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:23.900
But... If the chocolate doesn't taste good, wouldn't it be a bother to the one receiving it?

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:27.830
Even without high quality ingredients, you can make delicious chocolate.

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:29.660
Is that so?

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:30.930
You can make it for sure!

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:34.810
Hmm? If you're willing to go that far, Amano-san,

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.940
will you compete with me in making Valentine's chocolates?

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:40.180
That's fine. Let's do it.

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:44.190
Hey, Ichigo-chan, are you okay just accepting that challenge without thinking about it?

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:44.960
I'm fine!

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:51.540
Four days from today, Château confectionery will be hosting a Valentine's party.

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:56.750
There, between you and I, the one better at making chocolates will be settled.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:58.380
I understand.

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:05.240
Just so you know, Valentine's day is an event for girls. Getting help from guys in making chocolate is prohibited.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:09.610
Espe-cia-lly, don't you go around getting advice from Makoto-kun.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:11.300
O-O-Of course.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:12.850
I'll do everything by myself.

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:16.850
I see. Well then, in four days. I'll see you at the party.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:19.260
I'm <i>really</i> looking forward to it.

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:24.660
Meeting Ojou today really tired me out.

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:28.810
Anyway, going to a Valentine's chocolate challenge at a party...

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:30.350
Will you be all right?

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:33.730
But her saying all that made something click in my head!

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:36.650
Now that it's come to this, I'm going to make a chocolate that bests Koshiro-san's.

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:37.910
Yes! That's the spirit!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:42.170
You can't lose to Ojou's way of pricey "high quality" chocolate!

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:43.110
Yeah.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:50.470
Well then, I'll go to sleep before you.

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:52.050
Good night, Ichigo-chan.

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:53.850
Good night.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.230
I heard all of it.

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:57.230
So you were invited to a party?

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:59.700
Do you have a good dress?

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:01.450
I don't have anything like that.

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:03.160
I'll be going there in my usual school uniform.

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:04.600
But it's a party...

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:08.030
Forget the dress, my head is more filled up about the chocolate right now.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:10.870
What kind of chocolate should I make..?

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:15.660
There's so many to choose from, it's really difficult.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.210
Really. This and that, and the rest all look delicious.

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:20.650
Sigh. During times like this...

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:24.040
Ah! You thought "if only Kashino was around", didn't you?

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:29.020
T-That's not true! Guys are strictly forbidden when making Valentine's chocolate.

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:31.590
We need to solve this with girl power only.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:35.640
That's right. Chocolat's an expert when it comes to making chocolate...

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.140
...but for me, it's a bit...

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:38.410
Yeah...

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:43.560
But it's all right. It's a head-on battle between Koshiro-san and I, after all.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:47.150
I need to learn to be able to do things like this by myself.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.190
Well said. Ichigo, fight!

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:52.530
All right! I need to keep my spirits high so I won't lose, either.

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.060
Huh? Lose what?

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:56.820
Ah, no, nothing. Just talking to myself.

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:01.910
Makoto-kun!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.530
I found you.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.170
W-What is it?

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:11.400
To tell you the truth, for this Valentine's day, Chateau confectionery's hosting a party.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:13.380
I'm inviting you, so make sure you'll come, okay?

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:16.390
Ah, but I'm no good with parties.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:22.180
But, the main event this year is a chocolate challenge between Amano-san and I.

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:23.110
Eh!?

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:26.520
Ah, yeah it just sort of ended up like that...

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:33.820
So, since Amano-san's competing, as members of the A-group you'd want to know her results, right?

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:38.450
Thinking of everyone, I've prepared three tickets so you can all come.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:43.090
So that's how it is, Makoto-kun. Please attend the party, okay?

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:44.460
I'll be waiting.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.830
Amano-san, will you be fine competing all on your own?

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:52.520
Is there anything we can help with?

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:55.790
I'm very good at coordinating tables and things at parties.

00:08:56.410 --> 00:09:00.720
Thank you. But this time, I'm going to try doing it all by myself.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:03.510
I see. You seem really reliable.

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:05.670
So, what kind of chocolate are you going to compete with?

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:09.510
Ah, uh, that's... um...

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:13.340
It's Amano we're talking about. I bet she hasn't thought of anything yet.

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:15.410
Hey, I am thinking...

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:19.240
If it's Chateau confectionery's party, there will be a lot of celebrities.

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:21.330
The standards will be very high.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.040
Y-Yeah.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:27.850
I'm really looking forward to tasting Amano-san's chocolate.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:29.630
Really, really.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:33.380
Oh no! What should I do? It's exactly what Kashino said.

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:37.310
I haven't even decided on what chocolate I'll be making!

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:41.850
The party is the day after tomorrow, what should I do!?

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:48.980
Please make one immediately, just like the design I sent in the mail.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.900
No matter what, have it here by tomorrow morning.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:55.430
Yes! Of course your reward will be a hefty amount.

00:09:55.430 --> 00:10:01.610
Miya-ojousama. The gourmet Barry Callebaut chocolate made in France, we managed to get an order of 200 kilos.

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:06.280
Also, we managed to charter a refrigerated truck for transporting fruits.

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:12.030
Over here it's going good too, apparently once they finish they will be bringing it in by crane!

00:10:12.030 --> 00:10:15.710
Everything is going smoothly according to Miya-ojousama's plan.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:16.590
It's perfect!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:20.160
The most amazing ingredients with the most amazing presentation.

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.800
My victory is pretty much promised to me.

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.770
This challenge is like comparing the moon and a soft-shelled turtle!

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:30.140
No, a soft-shelled turtle is giving her too much. A pond slider is good enough for her.

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:34.310
I'll defeat Amano Ichigo with as much difference as the moon and a pond slider!

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:51.730
Well, I lined up the ingredients...

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:53.710
...but I can't imagine what I should do with them.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.600
Oh, when I think of it, I haven't seen Vanilla around today.

00:10:58.600 --> 00:10:59.760
Ichigo-chan!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.270
I finished my Valentine's chocolates!

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.630
If you want, please taste one.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:05.810
Let's see, let's see.

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:10.930
Totally delicious!

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:14.620
Inside my mouth, I can feel a breeze of spearmint passing through.

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:17.190
After that, the stings from the bitter chocolate is stimulating as well!

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.790
Doesn't it blow away sleepiness too?

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.620
Takuya is right in the middle of studying for his entrance exams.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:28.310
This mint chocolate, in my stead since he's far away, will refresh him and tell him "Good luck!"

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:31.960
It'll be by Takuya's side and give him encouraging shouts.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:37.960
I see. I'd forgotten a really important thing: Valentine's true meaning.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:45.290
For the past couple of days, I've only been thinking "What kind of chocolate do I need to make to beat Koshiro-san?"

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.480
But that's not it.

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:54.940
Valentine's chocolate goes through an amazing chemical reaction when a girl's feelings of "I love you" are melded in.

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:59.110
I want to tell you. This overflowing emotion.

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:02.490
Valentine Party

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:02.490
Chateau confectionery

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:10.850
As expected by a Chateau confectionery party. It's really lively.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:13.140
Kashino, that looks really good on you.

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:14.040
Leave it alone.

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:17.540
Here, this is my Valentine's chocolate.

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:19.550
Wow, thank you.

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:22.750
This is my chocolate of obligation.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:23.550
Thank you...

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:29.430
Since really early today, Andou has been receiving a looooot of chocolate.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:32.120
He filled up <i>two</i> cardboard boxes with them.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.580
Satsuki received <i>three</i> cardboard boxes.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.410
That's amazing.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:38.250
I bet Kashino got a lot too, didn't he.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:39.230
Zero.

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:45.780
Because, giving Kashino a chocolate is like sending him a declaration of war.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.350
I see...

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:55.720
So, time for tonight's main event. It's time to start the Valentine's chocolate challenge.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:13:00.720
Well then, Chateau confectionery's President Koshiro's eldest daughter, Miya-sama, is entering.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:02.940
Please give her your applause!

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:09.550
Next, her challenger: Amano Ichigo-san, please come this way.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:15.690
Well then, please try Miya-sama's Valentine's chocolate.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:21.890
What part of that is chocolate?

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:25.600
Some kind of huge tower is approaching. What could it be...?

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:29.520
This is my creation, Chocolate Fondue.

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:38.940
A-Amazing! A waterfall of 200 kilos of high quality Callebaut chocolate is pouring out without a second thought!

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:40.580
Bravo! Fantastic!

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:46.110
By the way my daughter woke up at 6 to bake these petit cream puffs, pretzels, and other bites.

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:48.580
Everyone, please eat until your heart's content.

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:51.130
How lavish.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:55.640
The fruits and baked sweets match this chocolate really well.

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:59.610
How is it, Makoto-kun? Delicious?

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:02.400
Made in France, gourmet Barry Callebaut chocolate...

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:07.140
If you used this much of this kind of chocolate, there's no way it can't taste good.

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:09.770
Right, right? It's delicious, right?

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:18.100
Amano Ichigo, no matter what kind of chocolate you bring, you won't leave so much as an impression.

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:21.080
Compared to my gorgeous Choco Fondue, that is.

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:23.750
What's this? It's delicious!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.040
Wow, what an interesting taste.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:29.840
It seems as though the challenger, Ichigo-san's chocolate is being presented.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:32.390
Go ahead. Please try these out.

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.790
Wow, it's a big success!

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:36.180
Vanilla, you're late.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:37.500
Ah, sorry, sorry.

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.870
What happened to your hand?

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:41.400
Nothing, nothing.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:42.220
Well then.

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:44.070
Magical macaron.

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:46.090
Sweets Romance Card.

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:48.180
Come out!

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:52.020
Hehe, complete.

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:54.320
Ichigo-chan, it looks delicious, doesn't it?

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:55.840
Wow, everyone.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:57.910
Did you do all of this by yourself?

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.720
Yeah. Thanks to that, I only got to sleep for 8 hours.

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:02.150
You mean too much.

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:03.990
Well without any further delay, I'll be having one.

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:06.920
Then, Hanabusa-kun, try this one.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.430
Huh? This is rose...

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.120
...no, that's not it.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:16.470
If you said rose it is definitely a rose, but something's different.

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:19.500
That's actually rose tea flavour.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:21.960
Rose tea? I see.

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:25.940
The black tea flavour is matching well with the rose scent.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.790
It's really delicious.

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:30.120
Then, I'll try the one over here.

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:35.310
This feeling, it's somewhat nostalgic.

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:37.800
This depth is... Black sugar?

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:39.610
That's correct.

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:42.310
I kept the chocolate around it from being too sweet,

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:46.040
and made the natural sweetness of the black sugar inside stand out.

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:48.250
Kashino, you try this one.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:54.890
Black pepper?

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:58.910
Isn't the prickly intensity of it delicious?

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:02.770
The truth is, when I was making these chocolates, I was thinking of you three.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.060
Us?

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:04.840
Yeah.

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:10.890
Rose tea for Hanabusa-kun. Black sugar for Andou-kun. And black pepper for Kashino.

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:12.990
Why am I coarse ground pepper?

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:18.990
Aren't I always being babysat by you three? I made this chocolate with my feelings of "thank you" inside.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:24.640
That's right, this black pepper chocolate. It goes really well with red wine.

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:26.250
I've really gotten into it.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.160
Thank you very much!

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:31.090
Hey, are there any more Rose tea chocolate left?

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.950
There are. Please have as much as you like.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:39.480
What's with that? Such dull chocolate.

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:41.710
De-licious! This flavour is really original.

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.100
Geez, even papa...

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.600
Koshiro Miya

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.600
Amano Ichigo

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:48.360
So I will be announcing the result of this chocolate challenge.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:51.360
Who will the Goddess of Fortune smile upon?

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:54.240
Please take a look at the score board!

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.000
What's that!?

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:10.710
What, both of you have 139 points. It's a draw!

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:16.250
This is a joke, isn't it? I tied with that shabby looking chocolate?

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:17.660
There must be a mistake!

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:22.600
Well, this time the challenge was really well matched.

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:27.270
The Choco Fondue from my daughter, which amazed the crowd with its chocolate waterfall.

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:32.440
And the brand-new taste; Amano-kun's chocolate, which made everyone say 'Ah!' with surprise.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:37.860
I believe that everyone can agree that the two are evenly matched.

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:43.620
A warm round of applause to the two of them who made such amazing chocolate!

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:53.890
Amano Ichigo, don't get conceited.

00:17:53.890 --> 00:18:01.570
This time it just happened to end up like this, but in the Cake Grand Prix, I'll show you my true ability.

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:02.500
Prepare yourself.

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:05.220
Uh, please go easy on me...

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:16.010
Naturally, Makoto-kun voted for me, right?

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:18.490
This time, I gave my vote to Amano.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:23.900
Why? You have a trained palate, Makoto-kun. Didn't you taste the difference?

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:28.160
Indeed, Koshiro-senpai's Choco Fondue was very extravagant.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:32.230
But this time it's a Valentine's chocolate challenge.

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:37.690
At the least, Amano's chocolate sent me her feelings of gratitude.

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:41.890
But I couldn't feel that from Koshiro-senpai's chocolate.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:46.910
No way... But, I always think of Makoto-kun...

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:51.060
But, compared to last year... this is a lot more delicious.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.820
Eh? Really?

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:58.360
So, for my reward... Let's dance together~!

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.260
Ah, papa?

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:02.030
I would be happy to, Mademoiselle.

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.120
Here, this way.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:07.540
Well, my daughter asking me to dance with her really makes me happy!

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:12.420
Papa. If you dance too much, you might hurt your back again.

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:17.160
Amazing. It looks like a ball from the storybooks!

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:19.450
Ichigo, come over here.

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:26.390
Princess change, roten card, make up.

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:28.890
What's with this dress?

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.380
I did my best making it.

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:34.480
For a party, a dress is required right?

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:40.810
You did all of this? Thank you!

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:44.660
There's one more thing needed for a party. It's a partner.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:46.660
Ichigo, good luck finding one.

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.320
Happy Valentine!

00:19:51.510 --> 00:19:54.350
Ichigo-chan, would you dance to a song with me?

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:58.210
Hanabusa-kun! But I haven't danced before.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:01.220
Don't worry. Leave it all to me.

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:07.390
Exactly. You're doing pretty good.

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:08.490
Ichigo-ch- Ow...

00:20:09.030 --> 00:20:10.460
Ah, sorry!

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:12.790
This would be a good time to switch partners.

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.920
That's right, let your shoulders relax.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:17.770
Yes, that's right.

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:19.770
Thank you, Andou-kun.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.060
You're getting on a pretty good beat.

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:25.070
Then, time to switch off again.

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:27.920
Geh, it's dress-Kashino.

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:32.200
Anyway, you must've thought for a while to think up of a chocolate like that.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.410
Ah, huh?

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:39.950
When I was thinking of making chocolate for Kashino, I kept remembering really bitter memories.

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:42.880
Before I knew it, I was holding black pepper in my hand.

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.510
Oh really?

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:48.880
But, how do I say it... I would like to eat it again.

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:49.780
Eh?

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:56.110
Huh? Ichigo's dress...

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:57.640
I thought I saw it somewhere!

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:59.320
It's from the school curtains.

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:02.980
Sssh! Please keep it a secret from Ichigo.

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.170
Happy Valentine!

00:21:11.780 --> 00:21:16.160
I hope that today will be a wonderful day for you!

