00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:57.850
These are this week's pointers.

00:24:00.180 --> 00:24:03.630
The opponent for the Cake Grand Prix's quarterfinals is Team Lemon:

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:05.860
The only team to have won through from the first-year students.

00:24:05.860 --> 00:24:10.290
Their leader, Yamagishi Lemon-chan, is a transfer student from St. Marie's Main Academy in Paris.

00:24:10.290 --> 00:24:11.760
She seems sincere and cute!

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:12.550
Naïve!

00:24:12.550 --> 00:24:13.930
Eh? Why?

00:24:14.850 --> 00:24:18.180
Eh? Andou-kun, your face looks really bleak, what happened?

00:24:18.180 --> 00:24:21.050
